flowchart TD
    A[Select pen, marker, eraser, shape or text] --> B[Choose color, size and opacity]
    B --> C[Pointer/touch or tracked fingertip input]
    C --> D{Tool type}
    D -- Pen or marker --> E[Interpolate smoothed stroke]
    D -- Eraser --> F[Destination-out on artwork layer only]
    D -- Line, rectangle, ellipse or arrow --> G[Drag start to end]
    D -- Text --> H[Place text and enter content]
    E --> I[Commit complete drawing item]
    F --> I
    G --> I
    H --> I
    I --> J[Independent artwork canvas]
    J --> K[Undo/redo item history]
    J --> L[Save/rename in local artwork library]
    J --> M[Render off-screen PNG canvas]
    M --> N[Transparent PNG contains artwork only]
    J --> O[Symmetry and optional guides]
